{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37021","headline":"岐王宅 · 罗隐","name":"岐王宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱邸平台隔禁闱，贵游陈迹尚依稀。\n云低雍畤祈年去，雨细长杨从猎归。\n申白宾朋传道义，应刘文彩寄音徽。\n承平旧物惟君尽，犹写雕鞍伴六飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}